(fset 'simula-mode '(autoload "simula" "Major mode for editing SIMULA code.
\\{simula-mode-map}
Variables controlling indentation style:
 `simula-indent-level'
    Indentation of SIMULA statements with respect to containing block.
 `simula-substatement-offset'
